    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαπό-δοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy of digestion</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐανάδοτος</span>
			 (q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy of solution</i> or <i>explanation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.4.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.85
			</span></i>.</div>
